{"parse":{"title":"个性/狂鬃","pageid":8085,"revid":19775,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>狂鬃</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8B.82.E9.AC.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"狂鬃\"><b>狂鬃</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 狂鬃.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/d2r0nrycb1gla2kqt2um6oj8qq31y5e.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/d2r0nrycb1gla2kqt2um6oj8qq31y5e.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/d2r0nrycb1gla2kqt2um6oj8qq31y5e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />狂鬃\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">8%</font>。<br />✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格。<br />✦攻击并造成伤害后，若目标生命值低于自身生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>时（且不超过自身物攻值100%），则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"抹煞\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">抹煞</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"群狮之猎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">群狮之猎</font></span></span>]，效果持续至下次行动开始。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">人形态</span>]时，每次造成伤害时计数，达<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>次后若再攻击，则唤醒血脉，进入[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"金狮形态•弱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">金狮形态•弱</font></span></span>]，并可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"立刻行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">立刻行动</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%AB%E9%98%9F%E2%80%9C%E7%8B%82%E9%AC%83%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/冰原卫队“狂鬃”\"><img alt=\"头像 冰原卫队“狂鬃”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b1/qcoicifavog648b9pa6ekgbac3ejj81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">冰原卫队“狂鬃”</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">12%</font>。<br />✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格。<br />✦攻击并造成伤害后，若目标生命值低于自身生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>时（且不超过自身物攻值100%），则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"抹煞\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">抹煞</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"群狮之猎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">群狮之猎</font></span></span>]，效果持续至下次行动开始。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">人形态</span>]时，每次造成伤害时计数，达<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>次后若再攻击，则唤醒血脉，进入[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"金狮形态•弱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">金狮形态•弱</font></span></span>]，并可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"立刻行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">立刻行动</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦最大生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">16%</font>。<br />✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格。<br />✦攻击并造成伤害后，若目标生命值低于自身生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>时（且不超过自身物攻值100%），则触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"抹煞\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">抹煞</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"群狮之猎\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font